WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:05.629
When Zhou Xiaoxuan posted on China’s social
network Weibo last summer, her accusation

00:00:05.629 --> 00:00:08.349
hit like a bombshell.

00:00:08.349 --> 00:00:13.269
She said she had been sexually harassed four
years ago by a famous TV anchor.

00:00:13.269 --> 00:00:14.269
Her post was quickly

00:00:14.269 --> 00:00:17.020
censored but it was already too late.

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:19.290
Her story had already been shared widely.

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:27.880
A lot of women who reposted this article wrote
that it reminded them of their own experiences.

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:32.059
I felt very sad, but was also moved.

00:00:32.059 --> 00:00:42.710
In 2014 Zhou, then a drama student, had been
interning at China’s state broadcaster CCTV.

00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:47.969
One day she was asked to come to the dressing
room of popular show host Zhu Jun.

00:00:47.969 --> 00:00:49.890
It is there she says he forcibly tried

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:52.069
to kiss and grope her.

00:00:52.069 --> 00:00:58.190
She managed to escape.

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:02.010
At first I didn’t want anybody to know I’d
been molested.

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:06.480
I felt this was embarrassing, humiliating.

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:11.750
And I also thought that if anybody knew about
this story, none of the CCTV employees would

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:13.720
take my side.

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:14.720
They

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:21.900
would stand with him.

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:26.540
The anchor has denied the accusations and
filed a lawsuit against her, He’s demanded

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:31.500
the equivalent of 85.000 euros for damaging
his reputation.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:41.530
Zhou Xiaoxuan is feeling the pressure.

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:46.460
I feel like a vessel that quickly fills up
with all kinds of emotions.

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:51.060
Most of the time I am so busy that I manage
to keep it together.

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:54.591
But sometimes you can’t suppress these feelings
anymore and that’s when I

00:01:54.591 --> 00:01:57.880
break down.

00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:05.750
Zhou has become a leading voice of China’s
small but persistent MeToo-Movement.

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:07.620
Many women have sought her advice.

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:10.929
She has offered to help some of them with
filing complaints at the police.

00:02:10.929 --> 00:02:11.959
But she says what

00:02:11.959 --> 00:02:19.340
China really needs is an open discussion about
the issue.

00:02:19.340 --> 00:02:24.980
When it becomes known that a woman has been
assaulted, people will say she has been “stained“.

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:27.209
Even the media use this word.

00:02:27.209 --> 00:02:30.900
The woman is considered dirty.

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:34.090
In the eyes of the public, women have to be
pure and a

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:45.370
woman who has been sexually harrassed is suddenly
seen as a strange, sick person.

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:48.139
As for Zhou Xiaoxuan – she’s fighting
back.

00:02:48.139 --> 00:02:53.300
After the presenter Zhu sued her for defamation,
she’s bringing her own case to court.

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:56.330
She’s demanding compensation for sexual
harassment.

